    "body": "Thanks for the feedback, Anne! I've updated the PR but I'll upload another patch that extends the example and note.\r\n\r\nThe build fails [at the deploy stage](https://github.com/schwering/html/actions/runs/5075868834/jobs/9117499385) though [because](https://github.com/schwering/html/blob/main/.github/workflows/build.yml#LL27C2-L27C2) I created this PR from schwering:main rather than a new branch. It [seems](https://stackoverflow.com/a/20014444) that GitHub does not allow renaming the source branch of an existing PR. I've uploaded a [built version](https://schwering.github.io/html/index.html#autofill), if that helps.",
